flowchart TD
  Inspect[Warehouse inspection: select actual bay] --> Quote[Exact whole packages and full staging layout]
  Quote --> Confirm{Same session/bay/quote and staging empty?}
  Confirm -->|keep or changed| NoChange[No mutation]
  Confirm -->|confirm| Claims[Ledger atomic whole-batch claims]
  Claims --> Lock[Close source bay to incoming deposits and reconfiguration]
  Lock --> Jobs[Tagged ordinary Other hauling jobs]
  Jobs --> Visit[Real shared worker visits staging]
  Visit --> Smoke[Existing1.5s smoke and actual compatible fixture]
  Smoke --> Pickup[Real source approach and2s pickup]
  Pickup --> Carry[Same package ID and origin physically carried]
  Carry --> Drop[Reached reserved staging cell and2s deposit]
  Drop --> More{All requested packages deposited?}
  More -->|no| Jobs
  More -->|yes| Unlock[Reopen source bay for normal receipt/reconfiguration]
  Drop --> Stage[Finite staging stock remains source-only]
  Stage --> Use[Ordinary physical collection for valid use]
  Use --> Empty{Actually empty and no access/promises?}
  Empty -->|yes| Quote
  Stop[Stop clearing] --> Release[Release uncollected claims; carried packages finish safe deposits]
  Release --> Unlock
  Block[Actual stock/occupancy/topology events] -. wake affected work .-> Jobs
  Forbidden[No ordinary freight, factory output, automatic overflow or single-person timber]
